Third-party notices
===================

This project vendors an engine that is not original to it. All of the
following are MIT-licensed, and their notices are preserved in
`server/vendor/` (see `VENDOR.json` for exact source, ref and SHA-256):

* dsh-rotakit (as bundled in
  2861292267/DSH-Official-WorkBuddy-Credit-Proxy) — MIT
* XDTrees/dsh-workbuddy-xdpool — MIT, author XDTrees
* dingminhua/dsh-connect-workbuddy — MIT (at-rest credential decryption)
* corrinehu/dsh-workbuddy-connect — MIT (shim hardening, error mapping)

The vendored files are marked "VENDORED — DO NOT EDIT BY HAND" at the top.
Local modifications are limited to repointing DSH host imports at
`host-stub.js` and exporting three internal observability factories; the
engine logic itself is upstream's.
